  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_1328acea-59f1-4a0e-a216-6743e66be8c9.png\" alt=\"關於電力？由 Tr3yMix 製作\" width=\"850\" height=\"283\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_2ae9178d-cd85-4b68-aa36-5317c1d4e361.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_c20746bf-4e97-4635-b4c8-56e32ae2fd9a.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_4d0ba42a-9008-41e4-a22a-72d6b0d16970.png\" alt=\"NeoForge\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>相依模組</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_9c999190-1b30-4ab8-bb3f-37979f849154.png\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_d8dba763-5746-4b59-ac79-f614dc3b1082.png\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_6241c1c3-131c-474a-ae1f-34b2b1c176b9.png\" alt=\"Architectury API\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>✨ <strong>關於本模組</strong>&nbsp;✨</p>\n<p>你是否曾想過只需開關一開，就能讓你的我的世界家園充滿生機，卻不用餵養那台吞噬資源的發電機？在 MrCrayfish 全新家具模組「Furniture Refurbished」的這個擴充模組協助下，現在你可以了！⚡</p>\n<p>本模組新增了一個名為「斷路器」的方塊。這個精巧的小方塊將成為你家供電系統的新心臟，直接從你喜愛的科技模組（如 Mekanism、Tech Reborn 和 Create: Crafts and Additions）汲取電力。再也不用為了發電機消耗煤炭，而這些煤本來可以用來製作火把或為營火提供燃料——現在只要簡單、永續的能量，就能讓你的燈泡持續發亮、吊扇不停運轉。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_46ddc807-aaad-4342-bb90-ab6143075cb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_3047e4e7-129f-4f3f-874c-bc834dcc5fa7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">*已於 Mekanism、Tech Reborn、Integrated Dynamics 與 Create Crafts &amp; Additions 測試通過。<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_700d7ff5-1383-4695-bb82-582298b9a06d.png\" alt=\"Mekanism\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/techreborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_a0daf121-03bc-4cc9-afac-9da1f774db83.png\" alt=\"Tech Reborn\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_a5079aaf-127e-4c58-9420-905fdbc3a336.png\" alt=\"Create Crafts &amp; Additions\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-dynamics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_bc03d42d-7d35-485f-af4c-0794803952ee.png\" alt=\"integrated dynamics\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>原始模組及其內容的完整功勞歸 MrCrayfish 所有。感謝您出色的工作！</p>",
